# Way of Work §13.1: code owners for high-risk areas only, so they always get an
# experienced reviewer without blocking everything else. Replace the team handles.
/.github/workflows/           @Accelerated-Innovation/<repo-lead-team>
/.wow.toml                    @Accelerated-Innovation/<repo-lead-team>
/.gitleaksignore              @Accelerated-Innovation/<repo-lead-team>
**/auth/                      @Accelerated-Innovation/<auth-owners>
**/Migrations/                @Accelerated-Innovation/<data-owners>
**/migrations/                @Accelerated-Innovation/<data-owners>
**/contracts/                 @Accelerated-Innovation/<contract-owners>
**/openapi*.json              @Accelerated-Innovation/<contract-owners>
